      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1568472786,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792780869959,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Your Wi-Fi is a gated society. Each building\ninside has a society number (private IP), which\nmeans nothing outside the gate. The world only\nknows the gate's address (public IP).\n\nThe watchman (router) notes who sent each letter,\nwrites the gate's address as the return address,\nand hands each reply back to the right building.\nThis is called NAT.",
      "originalText": "Your Wi-Fi is a gated society. Each building\ninside has a society number (private IP), which\nmeans nothing outside the gate. The world only\nknows the gate's address (public IP).\n\nThe watchman (router) notes who sent each letter,\nwrites the gate's address as the return address,\nand hands each reply back to the right building.\nThis is called NAT.",
